**15.** In relation to a Money “movable property in Singapore”, a Money “immovable property in Singapore”, a Money “the expenses of due administration”, a Money “the debts and liabilities” and a Money “the value beneficially disposed of by the will”, an estate in the case file means an estate in the case file, with creditors with movable property in Singapore, immovable property in Singapore, the expenses of due administration, the debts and liabilities, the value beneficially disposed of by the will and EMPTY.

