**19.** In relation to a Person “the child”, an optional Person “the father, if in evidence”, an optional Person “the mother, if in evidence”, a list of Guardian “his guardians” and a Money “the capital of his property”, an infant in the case file means Infant where the infant is the child, the father of the infant is the father, if in evidence, the mother of the infant is the mother, if in evidence, the guardians of the infant is his guardians, some other person has parental rights with respect to him is FALSE, the income of the property of the infant is 0, the capital of the property of the infant is the capital of his property and of an age to express an independent opinion is FALSE.

