**21.** In relation to a Kind of grant “what kind”, a list of Grantee “the grantees”, an optional DATE “when it was made” and a Limitation on the grant “the limitation on it”, a grant in the case file means Grant where the kind of grant is what kind, the grantees is the grantees, the date of the grant is when it was made, the limitation is the limitation on it, the court that made the grant is a court within the meaning of these Acts with the General Division of the High Court, the exception subject to which the grant is made is NOTHING, expired by effluxion of time or by the happening of the event or contingency on which it was limited is FALSE, revoked is FALSE, has given such security as is lawfully required to be furnished is TRUE, has been extracted is TRUE, sealed under section 47(1) of the Probate and Administration Act 1934 is FALSE and the date of the sealing is NOTHING.

